nce of effect modification. No context modification by screen quality, growth, hypoxia, or Wnt is established from these simple subgroup estimates; I registered two PTEN interaction checks to test context modification more directly. No independent validation can be requested because none remain. All conclusions are supplied-dataset associations, not causal, mechanistic, or generalizable claims.",
